## Deliverability and compliance are the same conversation

A real unsubscribe link, honest sender identity, and prompt suppression aren't just legal requirements under laws like CAN-SPAM and GDPR, they're exactly the signals email providers use to decide whether your domain is legitimate. Get the legal basics right and inbox placement tends to improve alongside it. See our [cold email compliance guide](/resources/blogs/cold-email-compliance-guide) for the specifics by region.
